        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "text": "Base Policy Form EQ-A-1 Ed. 01/2024\nThis policy provides Full Mortality coverage for the insured horse.\nThis policy provides Major Medical coverage with a limit of $15,000 per policy period.\nMajor Medical Deductible: $500\nReimbursement is 80 percent."
        },
