          "page": 3,
          "text": "Endorsement EQ-B-1 Ed. 01/2024\nSurgical coverage is added with a $10,000 occurrence limit.\nColic Surgery coverage is provided, subject to the surgical limit.\nEmergency Requirements\n- Notify the company within 24 hours of colic or serious illness.\n- A veterinarian must certify injury before authorization."
        }
